---
import Arrow from './Arrow.astro';
---

<section id="how-it-works" class="container how" aria-labelledby="how-title">
  <p class="eyebrow">How it works</p>
  <h2 id="how-title" class="section-title">One file declares it. A wasmtime host runs it.</h2>
  <p class="lede">
    Stages flatten into one ordered list of steps. Each step calls one middleware from a plugin and leaves
    namespaced outputs for the steps after it.
  </p>

  <ol class="flow">
    <li class="card">
      <p class="step">01 · declare</p>
      <h3>release.yml</h3>
      <p>Plugins, variables and stages in one YAML file.</p>
      <code class="chip">plugins · variables · stages</code>
    </li>
    <Arrow />
    <li class="card host">
      <p class="step">02 · execute</p>
      <h3>moonlit host</h3>
      <p>
        Resolves expressions, enforces grants, runs steps in order. Stops on the first failure unless a
        step sets <code class="inline-code">continueOnError</code>.
      </p>
      <code class="chip">$(output:version:nextVersion)</code>
    </li>
    <Arrow />
    <li class="card">
      <p class="step">03 · sandbox</p>
      <h3>WASM plugins</h3>
      <p>Each plugin is a component that sees only the network hosts, programs and paths you grant it.</p>
      <code class="chip">permissions: deny by default</code>
    </li>
  </ol>
</section>

<style>
  .how {
    padding-block: 112px 96px;
  }
  .lede {
    margin-bottom: 56px;
  }
  .flow {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    align-items: stretch;
    gap: 16px;
    margin: 0;
    padding: 0;
    list-style: none;
  }
  .card {
    flex: 1 1 260px;
    padding: 24px;
    border: 1px solid var(--edge);
    border-radius: 12px;
    background: var(--surface);
  }
  .host {
    border-color: var(--moon);
    background: #151411;
  }
  .step {
    margin: 0 0 6px;
    font: 500 12px var(--font-mono);
    color: var(--mute);
  }
  .host .step {
    color: var(--moon);
  }
  h3 {
    margin: 0 0 10px;
    font: 600 24px/1.15 var(--font-display);
  }
  .card > p:not(.step) {
    margin: 0 0 16px;
    font-size: 15px;
    color: var(--mute);
  }
  .chip {
    display: block;
    padding: 10px 12px;
    border-radius: 6px;
    background: var(--panel);
    font: 400 12px/1.6 var(--font-mono);
    color: var(--text);
  }
</style>
